     the switch fast turns round from wherever things are. Going to later, in three beats (times from the flip):
       (a) 0–460 ms    the ghost appears where a desk stood and two desks slide into their new places
       (b) 360–900 ms  the old access point, display and camera fade; the new ones drop in, 80 ms apart
